CLASS com/corrodinggames/rts/game/g com/corrodinggames/rts/game/Projectile
	COMMENT Projectile - the projectile DEFINITION/type (NOT a GameObject: the class has no superclass; static a is the shared "none/default" instance and ProjectileTemplate extends it). Every field name is the original one, recovered from the ini keys read by ProjectileTemplate.parse (custom/bh), which assigns them one to one: directDamage, areaDamage, areaRadius, areaRadiusFromEdge, areaDamageNoFalloff, areaIgnoreUnitsCloserThan, friendlyFire (+ friendlyFireOnlyIgnoreEnemy), areaHitAirAndLandAtSameTime, areaHitUnderwaterAlways, hasAreaDamage/hasNoAreaDamage (derived), interceptProjectileRemoveTargetLifeOnly, deflectionPower, nukeWeapon, shouldRevealFog, alwaysVisibleInFog, targetGround, targetGroundIncludeTargetHeight, targetGroundSpread, targetGroundHeightOffset, delayedStartTimer, life, speed, frame, shadowFrame, drawType, invisible, image, shadowImage, color, drawSize, teamColorRatio + teamColorRatioSourceRatio, speedSpread, initialUnguidedSpeedX/Y/Height, gravity, trueGravity, instant, instantReuseLast(+AlsoChangeTurretAim,+KeepAreaDamageList), disableLeadTargeting, leadTargetingSpeedCalculation, turnSpeed, turnSpeedWhenNear, sweepSpeed, sweepOffset, sweepOffsetFromTargetRadius, moveWithParent, drawUnderUnits, lightingEffect, laserEffect, beamImage/beamImageStart/beamImageEnd (+beamImageStartRotated/beamImageEndRotated, beamImageOffsetRate, hasBeamImage), ballistic, ballisticDelaymoveHeight, ballisticHeight, targetSpeed, targetSpeedAcceleration, autoTargetingOnDeadTarget(+Range,+Lead), retargetingInFlight(+SearchDelay/SearchRange/SearchLead/SearchOnlyTags), trailEffect/trailEffectRate/hasTrailEffect, effectOnCreate, spawnProjectilesOnCreate/OnExplode/OnEndOfLife (ProjectileList), wobbleAmplitude, wobbleFrequency, lightColor, lightSize, lightCastOnGround, largeHitEffect, flameWeapon, hitSound, explodeOnEndOfLife, pushForce, pushVelocity, buildingDamageMultiplier, shieldDamageMultiplier, shieldDefectionMultiplier, hullDamageMultiplier, armourIgnoreAmount, areaExpandTime, explodeEffect/explodeEffectOnShield, spawnUnit (UnitSpawner), unloadUpToXUnitsFromSource, teleportSource, convertHitToSourceTeam, tags, ignoreParentShootDamageMultiplier and the mutator lists directDamageMutators/areaDamageMutators/changedExplodeEffectMutators. a(Unit,int)/a(Unit,float,boolean) apply the mutators. [field names verified from the ini parser]
